---
// Footer.astro
---

<footer class="w-full bg-[#fafafa] border-t border-[#ebebeb] py-10 sm:py-16 text-xs text-[#8f8f8f] mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3.5 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-10">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Domain -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-[#171717] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xs">
            ₹
          </div>
          <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-[#171717]">Gratuity Calculator</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4d4d4d] max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          The open, verified calculation engine for Indian workforce gratuity payouts, governed by the Payment of Gratuity Act 1972 and CBDT Section 10(10) circulars.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigation -->
      <div class="space-y-2.5">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-[#171717] block">
          Calculations
        </span>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#4d4d4d]">
          <li><a href="#calculator" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Covered Establishments (15/26)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#calculator" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Non-Covered Firms (15/30)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#calculator" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Government Employees</a></li>
          <li><a href="#growth-matrix" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Future Increment Projections</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Legal & Reference -->
      <div class="space-y-2.5">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-[#171717] block">
          Acts &amp; Authorities
        </span>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#4d4d4d]">
          <li><a href="#comparison" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Payment of Gratuity Act, 1972</a></li>
          <li><a href="#taxation" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Income Tax Act Section 10(10)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faqs" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">The 4 Years 240 Days Precedent</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faqs" class="hover:text-[#171717] transition-colors">Section 7(3A) Delay Penalties</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Disclaimer & Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-[#ebebeb] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-[#8f8f8f]">
      <p class="max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This calculator is designed for informational and estimation purposes in accordance with the provisions of the Payment of Gratuity Act, 1972 and Section 10(10) of the Income Tax Act, 1961. Calculations may vary based on specific employment contracts, internal trust rules, and prevailing court interpretations. Consult an HR or tax professional for binding determinations.
      </p>
      <div class="shrink-0 font-mono">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Gratuity Calculator
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
